Section: misc
Priority: optional
Standards-Version: 4.6.2

Package: samba-adws
Version: 1.0.1
Maintainer: CaracalC <martin.ptit@gmail.com>
Architecture: all
Description: stand-in for samba-adws in the samba-powershell package test
 The samba-adws repository is private, so the CI workflow of samba-powershell
 cannot build the real package. This empty package satisfies the dependency so
 samba-powershell can be installed, exercised and purged in a clean container;
 the cmdlets then report that the samba-adws client is missing.
